<h2 id="review-criteria">Review Criteria</h2>

<p>Submissions will be evaluated based on the following criteria:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Originality and significance of the research</li>
  <li>Technical quality and methodological soundness</li>
  <li>Clarity of presentation</li>
  <li>Relevance to the conference theme</li>
  <li>Practical or theoretical contribution</li>
  <li>Validity of results and conclusions</li>
</ul>

